973
00:52:36,072 --> 00:52:37,640
Yeah, he's okay.
He's okay?

974
00:52:37,708 --> 00:52:39,977
Said he wanted
to hang out with you.

975
00:52:40,044 --> 00:52:41,277
He's okay.

976
00:52:41,345 --> 00:52:42,445
That's great.

977
00:52:42,514 --> 00:52:44,648
Okay.

978
00:52:44,716 --> 00:52:46,316
